WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.868
Harry: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:03.970
We wanted to find out all the
differences between Red Bull

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.605
in the UK and the US.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:07.107
This is Food Wars.

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:11.678
In the UK,

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.646
Red Bull comes in three portion sizes:

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.149
A 250-milliliter can,

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:18.418
a 355-milliliter can,

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:21.221
and a 473-milliliter can.

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:22.055
In the US,

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.958
our Red Bull cans come in four sizes,

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:28.628
8.4 fluid ounces, or 250 milliliters,

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:31.831
12 fluid ounces, or 355 milliliters,

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:36.002
16 fluid ounces, or 473 milliliters.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:37.404
And the biggest one,

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:42.175
20 fluid ounces — yo!
— or 591 milliliters.

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:46.413
That means our US largest size

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:49.716
is 30% bigger than the UK's.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.650
Harry: Let's see if we're actually getting

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.086
our 473 milliliters' worth.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:57.957
Actually, looks slightly more than 473.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.959
Maybe we're getting
even more for our money.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:01.728
The largest single item
by volume in the UK

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:05.198
is a 24-pack of our 355-milliliter cans.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:07.634
That totals 8,520 milliliters,

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:10.103
which is around 288 fluid ounces.

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:11.504
While we do have a larger can on offer,

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.039
that only comes as part of a 12-pack,

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:16.342
meaning that the total is
only 5,664 milliliters,

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.645
which is less than the
24-pack of this one.

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:21.948
In the US, our largest
Red Bull item is a 24-pack

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.451
of 12-fluid-ounce cans.

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:26.820
I was unable to get my hands on it,

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.556
but it is the same liquid
amount as the UK's largest.

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:34.127
Our closest second is a
12-pack of 24-fluid-ounce cans.

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.098
Here are all the Red Bull
products you'll find in the UK,

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:40.066
some of which you won't find in the US.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.001
Here are all the Red Bull items in the US

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:43.369
you won't find in the UK.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.638
So technically we have eight
Red Bull products in the UK.

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:46.573
We have the normal one,

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:47.707
we have the sugar-free one,

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:48.741
we have the zero one,

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:51.044
red, green, yellow, orange, and white.

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:51.911
Some of these are seasonal

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:52.946
and will rotate in and out,

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.280
so it's a little bit
tricky to keep track of

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.181
exactly what's on offer,

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.416
but this is what we could get today.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.250
In addition to this,

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.585
we have a couple of sugar-free exclusives,

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:00.253
which technically adds to the total.

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.254
From what I can tell,

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:03.389
these three flavors are
exclusive to the US,

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:05.558
and you can't find them in the UK.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:08.461
First, we have the blue edition,

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.763
which is blueberry flavored,

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.132
and we got the peach flavored,

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:14.400
which I believe is flavored peach,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.603
and the winter edition,

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:18.571
which is what flavor?

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.373
Fig apple? Hmm.

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:22.308
Now both countries have
the coconut flavor,

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:23.810
but from what I can tell online,

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.679
we also have the coconut
sugar-free flavor.

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.848
I actually couldn't even
find sugar-free versions

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:30.683
of the red one or the orange one.

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:32.886
I did find a sugar-free
yellow one, though.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:33.753
You can tell it's sugar-free

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:36.589
because it's got this blue
sugar-free band there,

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:37.790
blue sugar-free label there,

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.692
and also the tab is blue.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:40.627
That's quite fun.

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:42.362
While it's not technically a UK exclusive,

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.430
I did find this one while
I was hunting for Red Bull,

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.932
I think it's imported from Thailand,

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:48.301
and it's a
cold-brew-coffee-flavored Red Bull,

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:49.802
which sounds pretty intense.

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.738
Because there aren't too many exclusives

00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:53.206
